WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
Agus a-rithist.

00:01.000 --> 00:03.000
Càit’ an deach sibh ma thà?

00:03.000 --> 00:07.000
Uill, dh’fhàg– b’ fheudar dhomh an uairsin na docaichean fhàgail,

00:07.000 --> 00:08.000
tàilleabh siud.

00:08.000 --> 00:10.000
Bha mi fhìs is an Leòdhasach a bha seo,

00:10.000 --> 00:11.000
now an Leòdhasach bha e an toiseach,

00:11.000 --> 00:14.000
bha e, fhuair mi job dha actually anns an shipyard,

00:14.000 --> 00:17.000
agus am fear eile, fhuair mi [peantadh/?] dha anns an shipyard.

00:17.000 --> 00:19.000
Thaobh bha fear dhiubh na engineer co-dhiù,

00:19.000 --> 00:21.000
so fhuair mi job dhàsan,

00:21.000 --> 00:23.000
an uairsin fhuair mi job dham fhear eile a bha seo.

00:23.000 --> 00:27.000
[XX], dh’fhalbh e suas a dh’Alasga a dh’obair gu Hyder, Stewart

00:27.000 --> 00:30.000
Alaska, an… uill actually it’s Canada,

00:30.000 --> 00:37.000
dh’fheumadh tu dhol… shuas Stewart,

00:37.000 --> 00:38.000
ma tha fhios agad càit’ bheil Stewart,

00:38.000 --> 00:41.000
dh’fheumadh tu dhol through, son gum faigheadh tu dhan a’ mine,

00:41.000 --> 00:43.000
feumaidh tu chun na States agus an uairsin… chun am mine.

00:43.000 --> 00:45.000
Anyway, nuair a thòisich esan shuas an-sin,

00:45.000 --> 00:49.000
an uairsin bha Tormod Chaluim, bha esan shuas reimhid.

00:49.000 --> 00:52.000
“A Chaluim, feumaidh tusa a dhol suas an-seo.”

00:52.000 --> 00:54.000
So, packed everything up, dh’fhalbh sinn.

00:54.000 --> 00:56.000
’S tha cuimhn’ am gu bràth bha sinn,

00:56.000 --> 00:58.000
fad ’s a bha sinn a’ feitheamh ris a’ phleana bha seo,

00:58.000 --> 01:00.000
bha sinn ann an– chuir iad ann an hotel

01:00.000 --> 01:01.000
sinn a’ feitheamh ris a’ phlèan.

01:01.000 --> 01:05.000
Bha quarter air an uinneig, air neo, dolar neo rudeigin,

01:05.000 --> 01:08.000
an dolar mu dheireadh– cheannaich sinn cigar an t-aon.

01:08.000 --> 01:11.000
Fear fada-sa [XX] ga smocadh fhad ’s bha sinn a’ feitheamh ris a’ phlèan.

01:11.000 --> 01:14.000
Uill, bha eagal mo [XX] ormsa a’ dol suas,

01:14.000 --> 01:16.000
cha robh mise eòlach air a’ phlèan bheag a bha seo,

01:16.000 --> 01:18.000
agus na bogsaichean, na tools air aon taobh.

01:18.000 --> 01:20.000
Agus tha i a’ dol sìos ’s a’ wobbleadh ’s a h-uile sgath

01:20.000 --> 01:24.000
mun cuairt air na… cha b’ urrain dha dhol suas anns an adhar ro fhada idir,

01:24.000 --> 01:29.000
bha i gu math goirid dhan uisge, suas, right up.

01:29.000 --> 01:32.000
Anns an latha, cha robh even rathad ann suas gu Stewart an uairsin,

01:32.000 --> 01:34.000
cha robh sgath ann, dìreach feum thu plèana…

01:34.000 --> 01:37.000
an aon, aon uair a gheibheadh tu a-staigh, plèan. 

01:37.000 --> 01:39.000
Uill land sinn an-sin, uill, my gosh.

01:39.000 --> 01:44.000
An ath rud, a bhalaich, an oidhche seo chaidh sinn a choimhead son Iain a bha seo.

01:44.000 --> 01:46.000
Cha do dh’inns sinn dha gun robh sinn a’ dol suas idir,

01:46.000 --> 01:48.000
ach gum faiceadh sinn e.

01:48.000 --> 01:51.000
Agus gun fhios agam ach an ath rud, a bhalaich, pew,

01:51.000 --> 01:54.000
bha rocaid a’ dol às gach taobh dhiom.

01:54.000 --> 01:55.000
An uairsin, fhios agad, an Cold War,

01:55.000 --> 01:57.000
bha dùil agam gur e na Ruiseanaich a bha gar raideadh,

01:57.000 --> 01:58.000
honest to God.

01:58.000 --> 01:59.000
Fhios agad dè bh’ ann?

01:59.000 --> 02:01.000
Feadhainn a’ shootadh na avalanches,

02:01.000 --> 02:04.000
son gun tuit– son gum bristeadh iad na h-avalanaches,

02:04.000 --> 02:06.000
thaobh chaidh còrr is leth-cheud daoine a mharbhadh

02:06.000 --> 02:09.000
bho chionn deich bliadhna roimhe sin.

02:09.000 --> 02:12.000
Chaidh, rug iad air sa champ agus bha iad wiped right out.

02:12.000 --> 02:14.000
So, hire iad an fheadhainn a bha seo son fire-adh,

02:14.000 --> 02:16.000
fhios agad, blastadh na h-avalanches.

02:17.000 --> 02:21.000
Ach co-dhiù, fhuair mi job air heavy-duty mechanic.

02:21.000 --> 02:23.000
Cha robh [XX] agamsa mu heavy-duty mechanic,

02:23.000 --> 02:28.000
each is cairt ann am Barraigh, that’s the only mechanical a b’ aithne dhomhsa.

02:30.000 --> 02:33.000
An rud a b’ fheudar dhuinn a dhèanamh an uairsin,

02:33.000 --> 02:35.000
mun oidhche ud nach robh fios agam dè bha mi a’ dèanamh,

02:35.000 --> 02:38.000
thug esan dhomhsa na tools aigesan,

02:38.000 --> 02:42.000
agus cheannaich sinn tools ùra dhàsan, thaobh,

02:42.000 --> 02:44.000
bha fios aca gun robh esan ann reimhid, so

02:44.000 --> 02:48.000
nuair a chìtheadh e na tools ùra, cha dèanadh e càil a dhiofar.

02:48.000 --> 02:50.000
Ach nam faiceadh e na tools ùra agamsa, [ormsa?]

02:50.000 --> 02:52.000
’s gun fhios ’am dè bha mi a’ dèanamh,

02:52.000 --> 02:54.000
bhiodh fhios aige gur e fake a bh’ annam.

02:54.000 --> 02:58.000
So leis na seann tools, uill ’s aithne dhan fhear sin rudeigin,

02:58.000 --> 03:00.000
fhios agad, thaobh bha na tools ud [laughs].

03:01.000 --> 03:03.000
Anyway, chaidh sinn suas and while,

03:03.000 --> 03:05.000
nuair a bhiodh iad a’ dèanamh am blast,

03:05.000 --> 03:08.000
nam bristeadh iad sìos, na machines, jum– [XX],

03:08.000 --> 03:10.000
chan eil fhios agamsa càil mun deidhinn,

03:10.000 --> 03:12.000
bhiodh iad ag èigheach ormsa,

03:12.000 --> 03:13.000
’s mise am mechanic.

03:13.000 --> 03:16.000
Cho fad ’s a bha mi fhìn san explosives box,

03:16.000 --> 03:18.000
son leth-uair an uaireadair neo rudeigin, fhios agad,

03:18.000 --> 03:22.000
tèideadh fear eile suas a dhèanamh repairs.

03:22.000 --> 03:24.000
Agus an uairsin, dh’fheumainn fhàgail.

03:24.000 --> 03:27.000
Ach nuair bha am blast ann, dh’fheumadh a h-uile duine fàgail,

03:27.000 --> 03:30.000
an uairsin dh’fhàgadh iad am blast is dh’fhalbh iad dhan avalanche.

03:30.000 --> 03:31.000
Uill, dh’fhuirich sinn an-sin son…

03:31.000 --> 03:35.000
’s dòcha gun robh mi shuas son ceala-deug neo trì seachdainean,

03:35.000 --> 03:38.000
chaidh Iain a mharbhadh, ar caraid.

03:38.000 --> 03:44.000
So, thug, oh… thug sin a cholainn suas gu Stewart agus,

03:44.000 --> 03:46.000
tha e doirbh a chreidsinn,

03:46.000 --> 03:51.000
bha Leòdhasach a’ fuireach ann an Stewart aig an robh hotel.

03:51.000 --> 03:55.000
Uill, cha b’ urrainn dhomh a dhol ceàrr an uairsin sa hotel,

03:55.000 --> 03:57.000
booze, a h-uile sgath riamh.

03:57.000 --> 04:00.000
Bha, an gille a chaidh a mharbhadh, ’s ann à Leòdhas a bha e,

04:00.000 --> 04:06.000
ach bha job diabhalta againn a’ faighinn sìos gu Canada à Stewart,

04:07.000 --> 04:09.000
chionn cha robh iad toilichte, am mine company,

04:09.000 --> 04:11.000
a cholainn a thoirt a-mach à… às an area idir,

04:11.000 --> 04:14.000
cha robh an t-acras aca sin a dhèanamh.

04:14.000 --> 04:17.000
Thaobh chaidh a cheann a ghearradh aige, bha e ann an droch mhess.

04:17.000 --> 04:21.000
So, chaidh a mharbhadh just, right off the bat.

04:21.000 --> 04:26.000
Agus, co-dhiù, mise an aon fhear a thachair ri mhàthair

04:26.000 --> 04:28.000
’s ri athair ann an Lunnainn,

04:28.000 --> 04:30.000
so b’ fheudar dhomhsa fònadh a dh’innse dhaibh.

04:30.000 --> 04:33.000
Uill, cha do dh’fhòn even na poileasman neo duine iad.

04:33.000 --> 04:36.000
Oh Dhia, bha e doirbh.  [bha e tough?]

04:36.000 --> 04:41.000
Ach [XX] hotel, [XX] fòn, [XX] the booze, the whole thing.

04:41.000 --> 04:43.000
Bha sinn ann son ceithir neo còignear latha

04:43.000 --> 04:47.000
mun d’ fhuair sinn permission son a cholainn a thoirt sìos gu Prince Rupert,

04:47.000 --> 04:50.000
an uairsin fhuair sinn à Prince Rupert a-null a Chanada, an uairsin

04:50.000 --> 04:52.000
right sìos gu… [XX].

04:52.000 --> 04:53.000
Sin aon trup cha deach mi,

04:53.000 --> 04:58.000
cha do dh’iarr mi tuilleadh ’s [XX] copper mill,

04:58.000 --> 05:00.000
neo copper mine.

05:00.000 --> 05:02.000
Agus an copper mine, an àite a bhith a’ dol sìos ann,

05:02.000 --> 05:04.000
bha thu a’ dol suas ann.

05:04.000 --> 05:08.000
Spiral a’ dol suas, sin mar a bha am mine, a’ dol suas.

05:08.000 --> 05:13.000
Uill, sin mar a land mi an-sin, so… oh Dia.

05:13.000 --> 05:15.000
Càit’ deach sibh an uairsin?

05:15.000 --> 05:16.000
Oh Dhia, fuirich thusa a-niste.

05:16.000 --> 05:20.000
An dèidh sinn fhàgail, thug sinn a cholainn dhachaigh,

05:20.000 --> 05:22.000
agus cho fad ’s a bha sinn an Glaschu.

05:22.000 --> 05:25.000
Actually, chollect iadsan e, na daoine, ann am Vancouver,

05:25.000 --> 05:27.000
dà mhile not actually,

05:27.000 --> 05:31.000
dà mhile dolar– dà mhillean dolar, two hundr– two thousand.

05:32.000 --> 05:34.000
Thug sinn an t-airgead agus thug sinn a cholainn dhachaigh,

05:34.000 --> 05:38.000
thìodhlaic sinn ann an Leòdhas e, thill sinn a Bharraigh.

05:38.000 --> 05:42.000
An uair– oh my God, [XX], I won’t go into that one!

05:42.000 --> 05:45.000
Agus nuair a chaidh sinn a Ghlaschu, uill,

05:45.000 --> 05:49.000
cha robh Tormod riamh ann am bookie shop, cha b’ aithne dhomhsa,

05:50.000 --> 05:56.000
bhithinnsa a’ ruith [XX], dice board air bàtaichean is air a’ waterfront

05:56.000 --> 05:58.000
’s a h-uile sgath riamh.

05:58.000 --> 06:01.000
So chaidh esan dhan a’ bhookie shop a bha seo

06:01.000 --> 06:03.000
agus chuir– tha cuimhn’ am gu bràth, chuir mi ceithir–

06:03.000 --> 06:07.000
deich notaichean air trì eich, one after the other,

06:07.000 --> 06:10.000
an t-airgead. A bhalaichibh mar– agus ma chuireadh tu,

06:10.000 --> 06:17.000
10 notaichean, airgead mòr, mòr a bha sin an 1967 or 68,

06:17.000 --> 06:18.000
something like that.

06:18.000 --> 06:21.000
Airgead mòr, mòr. Agus feadhainn na docaichean,

06:21.000 --> 06:24.000
suit jackets agus poca, sandwich aca nam pòca ’s [XX],

06:24.000 --> 06:27.000
Canadian jackets.

06:27.000 --> 06:30.000
Oh, ten pounds! A dhiabhail, a’ chiad dhà each, a bhalaich,

06:30.000 --> 06:33.000
nach do bhuinnig iad? Thòisich am bookie a’ coimhead orm,

06:33.000 --> 06:36.000
bha mi a’ faicinn– agus a h-uile duine a bha sa bhookie shop,

06:36.000 --> 06:37.000
bha fhios aca gun robh an double agam,

06:37.000 --> 06:39.000
bha mi a’ feitheamh ris an treas fhear,

06:39.000 --> 06:41.000
ris an each eile a’ tighinn a-staigh.

06:41.000 --> 06:43.000
Uill, thuirt Tormod: “Dè tha ceàrr?”

06:43.000 --> 06:45.000
Is dh’inns mi do Thormoid [XX],

06:45.000 --> 06:47.000
ach cho fad ’s– an uairsin thòisich an race,

06:47.000 --> 06:49.000
oh, tha cuimhn’ am gu bràth air.

06:49.000 --> 06:50.000
Thòisich mise: 

06:50.000 --> 06:53.000
“Cuiridh sinn uinneag ùr ann a shiud is fosglaidh sinn siud suas.

06:53.000 --> 06:55.000
Gabhaidh sinne tiops ann a shiud is gabhaidh sinn botal.”

06:55.000 --> 06:58.000
Well, laugh! [XX], just a’ bruidhinn,

06:58.000 --> 07:00.000
but I’m babbling away, fhios agad,

07:00.000 --> 07:02.000
a’ designeadh am bookie shop,

07:02.000 --> 07:04.000
an rud a tha sinn a’ dol a dhèanamh nuair a bhuinnigeas sinn.

07:04.000 --> 07:07.000
Bhuinnig mi seven hundred odd pounds, ceithir cheud not.

07:07.000 --> 07:11.000
Bha sin coltach ri trì bliadhna de phàigheadh an uairsin.

07:11.000 --> 07:13.000
Equivalent of three years.

07:14.000 --> 07:17.000
Deich latha an dèidh sin,

07:17.000 --> 07:20.000
bha mi sa Salvation Army ann an Thunder Bay,

07:20.000 --> 07:22.000
gun an diabhail de sgillinn.

07:23.000 --> 07:26.000
The whole thing, not a penny.

07:26.000 --> 07:30.000
Oh my God, na triùir againn.

07:30.000 --> 07:32.000
Ciamar a chaill sibh an t-airgead?

07:32.000 --> 07:34.000
Uill, oh cha robh e doirbh a chaill– a chall.

07:34.000 --> 07:37.000
A’ chiad rud a rinn sinn, fhuair sinn càr.

07:37.000 --> 07:40.000
Lìon sinn le uisge-beatha, fhuair sinn dusan,

07:40.000 --> 07:43.000
neo barrachd ri dusan, botail de dh’uisge-beatha is lionn,

07:43.000 --> 07:44.000
is a h-uile sgath riamh.

07:44.000 --> 07:47.000
Bha sinn a’ dol a dhraibheadh mun cuairt feadhainn a b’ aithne dhuinn.

07:47.000 --> 07:49.000
’S mathaid gun do dh’fhàg sinn ri taobh a’ bhàr e,

07:49.000 --> 07:51.000
cha do ghluais an càr idir,

07:51.000 --> 07:53.000
cha do chur mi aon mhìle air a’ chàr!

07:53.000 --> 07:57.000
Bha sinn feadh an àite, seac– lèine, ùr a h-uile latha.

07:58.000 --> 08:03.000
Fhuair sinn, tha cuimhn’ am air an deise, deise iongantach.

08:03.000 --> 08:06.000
An uairsin, actually, nuair a bhuinnig sinn an t-airgead,

08:06.000 --> 08:08.000
cha b’ urrainn dhan bhookie mo phàigheadh,

08:08.000 --> 08:09.000
fhios agad, so bha Tormod ag ràdh:

08:09.000 --> 08:11.000
“Dè tha thu a’ dol a dhèanamh a-niste, a Chaluim?”

08:11.000 --> 08:13.000
“Uh, gabh air do shocair, watch thusa seo.”

08:13.000 --> 08:16.000
So, bha Tormod nas bige na mise, bha e gam leanadh.

08:16.000 --> 08:18.000
Chaidh mi suas thuige:

08:18.000 --> 08:20.000
“Oh, sorry man,” you know mar a tha iad a’ bruidhinn ann an Glaschu,

08:20.000 --> 08:22.000
“a cannae pay you.”

08:22.000 --> 08:24.000
Arsa mise: “Tha e taghta.

08:24.000 --> 08:26.000
Can ri guarantor, but faigh greim air an-dràsta,

08:26.000 --> 08:28.000
tha mi ag iarraidh an airgid a fhuair mi an-dràsta.”

08:28.000 --> 08:30.000
Uill feumaidh iad sin a dhèanamh.

08:30.000 --> 08:32.000
So dh’fhòn e a ghuarantor, an ath rud, a bhalaich,

08:32.000 --> 08:35.000
bha limousine a’ tighinn gam iarraidh.

08:35.000 --> 08:37.000
Agus am bodyguard.

08:38.000 --> 08:43.000
The driver, the bodyguard agus Tormod… bràthair,

08:43.000 --> 08:45.000
fhios agad an tè a bha thu a’ bruidhinn ris an-dràst’,

08:45.000 --> 08:48.000
mo phiuthair, an duine aice-se, dh’eug e a-nise,

08:48.000 --> 08:50.000
a bhràthair, agus mise.

08:50.000 --> 08:53.000
Na triùir againn sa limousine a bha seo,

08:53.000 --> 08:55.000
suas Buchanan Street.

08:55.000 --> 08:58.000
Chaidh sinn suas an staidhre, poidhle mòr de cheithir,

08:58.000 --> 09:00.000
seachd ceud not.

09:00.000 --> 09:02.000
Airgead mòr, mòr a bha sin.

09:02.000 --> 09:05.000
So thug mi poidhle mòr dheth is thug mi do,

09:05.000 --> 09:07.000
cha do chunntais mi e, thug mi do Thormoid e:

09:07.000 --> 09:08.000
“Seo, cuir thu siud sa phòca.”

09:08.000 --> 09:13.000
[XX] do, do bhràthair Iain, am balach eile.

09:13.000 --> 09:15.000
“Dè tha thu– carson a tha thu dheth an-diugh? Dè tha…”

09:15.000 --> 09:19.000
Bha e [XX] nuair a bhuinnig sinn an t-airgead, ’s dh’fhaighnich e:

09:19.000 --> 09:20.000
“Dè tha thu a’ dol a dhèanamh leis an airgead?”

09:20.000 --> 09:22.000
Arsa mi: “Tha mi a’ dol a chur air each eile.”

09:22.000 --> 09:25.000
Theich e a-mach! Bha dùil aige gun robh mi a’ dol a dhèanamh sin.

09:25.000 --> 09:28.000
Cha do rinn mi sin idir. Thug mi an t-airgead [XX]. Anyway:

09:28.000 --> 09:30.000
“Tha thu– dè bha thu a’ dol a dhèanamh?”

09:30.000 --> 09:32.000
“Oh, bha sinn, bha mi a’ dol a cheannach càr.” 

09:32.000 --> 09:34.000
Na càr beagaichean a bh’ aig na nursaichean.

09:34.000 --> 09:38.000
Bha iad mu twenty-five, thirty pounds, forty pounds, second-hand.

09:38.000 --> 09:41.000
“Seo, a bhalaich, ceannaich a dhà dhiubh.”

09:42.000 --> 09:44.000
So dh’fhalbh mi fhìn is Tormod sìos an t-sràid an uairsin,

09:44.000 --> 09:47.000
piles de dh’airgead aige.

09:47.000 --> 09:49.000
Of course, bha an t-aodach againn salach,

09:49.000 --> 09:52.000
seachdain gun changeadh neo sgath.

09:52.000 --> 09:55.000
So, bha bùth tàilleir a bha seo.

09:55.000 --> 09:57.000
Ach bha am bùth shìos gu h-ìosal, fhios agad,

09:57.000 --> 09:58.000
’s na steapaichean a’ dol sìos.

09:58.000 --> 10:05.000
[XX] sin: bùth snog, seacaidean, lèintean is… fhios agad,

10:05.000 --> 10:07.000
a h-uile sgath riamh ann, deiseachan.

10:07.000 --> 10:10.000
So, thuirt mi ris a’… “Can I help you sir?

10:10.000 --> 10:12.000
Arsa mise: “See, coimhead air an deise tha siud?

10:12.000 --> 10:14.000
Bheir dhàsan an deise tha sin,

10:14.000 --> 10:16.000
agus gabhaidh mis’ an deise ud.”

10:16.000 --> 10:22.000
Bheil cuimhn’ agad air… dè chanadh tu ris?

10:22.000 --> 10:25.000
Cha robh lapels idir orra, James Bond suits.

10:25.000 --> 10:27.000
Cuimhn’ agad air a siud?

10:27.000 --> 10:31.000
Remember that? Anyway, thuirt mi ri Tormod:

10:31.000 --> 10:32.000
“Gabh thusa an tè ud.” 

10:32.000 --> 10:35.000
So, bha sinn a’ strippeadh ’s a… ach dhiochuimhnich mi,

10:35.000 --> 10:37.000
choimhead mi air an fhear aig an robh am bùth,

10:37.000 --> 10:39.000
agus thòisich e ri gabhail an eagal.

10:39.000 --> 10:42.000
A thaobh thug mise an t-airgead a bha sin ’s dh’fhàg mi air a’ bhòrd e.

10:42.000 --> 10:45.000
Bha dùil aige gun do rob mi banca neo rudeigin!

10:45.000 --> 10:47.000
M’ onair a Dhia, thionndaidh an dath,

10:47.000 --> 10:50.000
bha e, thionndaidh e geal, agus dh’fhalbh e, fhios agad,

10:50.000 --> 10:51.000
bha staidhre a’ dol suas.

10:51.000 --> 10:54.000
Sheas e air an staidhre agus [XX] e,

10:54.000 --> 10:55.000
gus nach b’ urrainn dhuinn teicheadh.

10:55.000 --> 10:58.000
Thug sinn a h-uile sgath dhinn, thug sinn na deiseannan, lèine oirnn,

10:58.000 --> 11:01.000
tàidh, agus thuirt mise: “A bheil brògan agad?”

11:01.000 --> 11:04.000
“Tha brògan–”
“No,” arsa mise, “tha mise ag iarraidh na brògan

11:04.000 --> 11:07.000
a… feumaidh mi deich notaichean a phàigheadh.”

11:07.000 --> 11:09.000
“Oh, chan eil feadhainn mar sin agamsa,” ars esan.

11:09.000 --> 11:11.000
“Uill, chan eil mi ag iarraidh feadhainn son dà not,

11:11.000 --> 11:12.000
feumaidh iad deich notaichean.”

11:12.000 --> 11:14.000
B’ fheudar dhomh a dhol gu aon-deug bhùthan

11:14.000 --> 11:17.000
mun d’ fhuair sinn paidhir bhrògain aig deich notaichean.

11:17.000 --> 11:20.000
Laugh! Anyway, sin agad mar a land sinne,

11:20.000 --> 11:22.000
a thàinig sinn air ais a Barraigh.

11:22.000 --> 11:27.000
An uairsin, of course, dh’fhalbh, chuir an diabhal duine,

11:27.000 --> 11:29.000
mèirleach a bha ann an Glaschu,

11:29.000 --> 11:30.000
thàinig iad a choimhead oirnn sa phub,

11:30.000 --> 11:33.000
bha sinn sa Phark Bar a h-uile oidhche.

11:33.000 --> 11:35.000
Bhiodh iad a’ reic tools thugainn ’s a h-uile,

11:35.000 --> 11:37.000
sgath sam bith, ’s bha sinne a’ ceannach a h-uile sgath, we didn’t care.

11:37.000 --> 11:40.000
Bha bogsaichean den h-uile sgath agam.

11:40.000 --> 11:42.000
Agus bha dùil ’am an toirt leam,

11:42.000 --> 11:43.000
ach an tàinig deireadh na seachdain,

11:43.000 --> 11:46.000
cha robh airgead agam son a phàigheadh an excess luggage.

11:46.000 --> 11:48.000
So dh’fhàg mi ann a shin iad.

11:48.000 --> 11:51.000
No, thug mi dhan airport iad, ann an tacsi.

11:51.000 --> 11:53.000
Agus thuirt mise dhan left luggage:

11:53.000 --> 11:56.000
“I’ll be back, ann an ceala-deug eile, bidh mi air ais.”

11:56.000 --> 12:00.000
Huh! Thug e trì bliadhna mun do thill mi air ais,

12:00.000 --> 12:04.000
thug iad ’s land sinn an Glaschu, land sinn am Vancouver,

12:04.000 --> 12:07.000
agus an dèidh diabhladas agus a h-uile sgath riamh,

12:07.000 --> 12:09.000
cha robh sinn a’ faireachdainn comfortable ann.

12:09.000 --> 12:12.000
Dè mu dheidhinn tilleadh air ais a Ontario?

12:12.000 --> 12:15.000
So ruig sinn air bus, chaidh sinn gu Thunder Bay,

12:15.000 --> 12:18.000
chionn bha càirdean aig Tormod ann an Thunder Bay,

12:18.000 --> 12:20.000
agus chaidh sinn dhan a’ Salvation Army

12:20.000 --> 12:22.000
is dh’fhuirich sinn an-sin airson oidhche.

12:22.000 --> 12:27.000
Fhuair mise bàta, right off the bat. [XX], engineer, pew!

12:27.000 --> 12:31.000
Can’t refuse him. Ach chan fhaigheadh Tormod air,

12:31.000 --> 12:34.000
ged ’s e esan am proper engineer, bha esan qualified engineer!

12:34.000 --> 12:36.000
Bha ’s a h-uile sgath ann am Breatainn.

12:36.000 --> 12:39.000
Anyway, leum mise air bàta.

12:43.000 --> 12:47.000
[XX] an Salvation Army, cha b’ urrainn dhomh even an Salvation Army a phàigheadh,

12:47.000 --> 12:49.000
cha robh sgillinn againn air fhàgail.

12:49.000 --> 12:52.000
Cuiridh mi geall nach robh dà dholar eadar na dithis againn

12:52.000 --> 12:54.000
by the time a land sinn am Van–

12:54.000 --> 12:57.000
dè na bha siud de dh’airgead deich latha roimhe sin.

12:57.000 --> 12:59.000
Anyway, an ath rud, a bhalaich,

12:59.000 --> 13:06.000
bha mi air bàta ann a sheo a-rithist so… [XX] an uairsin.

13:07.000 --> 13:10.000
Thòisich sinn air obair an-siud ’s an-seo is… a’ reic.

13:12.000 --> 13:16.000
Uill actually no, cheannaich mi piano accordion, actually,

13:16.000 --> 13:20.000
ann an St. Catherine’s, rinn mi check nach robh sgath innte,

13:20.000 --> 13:24.000
agus thàinig mi a-nuas le… Fhuair mi job an toiseach air a’ bhàta,

13:24.000 --> 13:25.000
thàinig mi a St. Catherine’s

13:25.000 --> 13:28.000
is dh’inns cuideigin dhomh mu dheidhinn an job ann a’ Nanticoke.

13:28.000 --> 13:31.000
“Oh,” arsa mise, “’s toil leamsa na jobs sin.”

13:31.000 --> 13:33.000
Bha mi a’ dèanamh sin ann an Kincardine,

13:33.000 --> 13:36.000
sin an job a fhuair mi, fhios agad, nuair a fhuair mi nam engineer an-sin.

13:36.000 --> 13:39.000
So, pff, pay off the boat, phàigh mi dhith,

13:40.000 --> 13:42.000
thachair mi ri balach eile ann an St. Catherine’s,

13:42.000 --> 13:45.000
dh’fhurich mi còmhla ris-san air an oidhche sin,

13:45.000 --> 13:48.000
fhuair mi… a dhà neo trì làrna-mhàireach,

13:48.000 --> 13:50.000
thàinig a-nuas– hitchhike mi suas gu… no,

13:50.000 --> 13:52.000
chaidh mi dhan Union an toiseach.

13:52.000 --> 13:58.000
Thug an Union dhomh job… compressor man, shìos ann a’ Nanticoke here.

13:58.000 --> 14:00.000
Uill, suas a thàinig sinn ann a sheo.

14:00.000 --> 14:04.000
Uill, tha cuimhn’ am an hitchhiking, oh my Gosh.

14:04.000 --> 14:06.000
Dà uair sa mhadainn neo rudeigin,

14:06.000 --> 14:09.000
agus thug an càr a bha seo a’ dol seachad, fhios agad,

14:09.000 --> 14:11.000
cha mhòr am meadhan an rathaid a’ feuchainn ri stad.

14:11.000 --> 14:13.000
Mac an Diabhail, chaidh e seachad orm.

14:13.000 --> 14:16.000
Ach thionndaidh e sìos far an robh mi a’ dol a bhith ag obair.

14:16.000 --> 14:20.000
So mun deach mi seachad air [XX], bha an doras aige fosgailte.

14:20.000 --> 14:22.000
“Oh,” ars esan, “tha mi duilich nach robh–

14:22.000 --> 14:25.000
cha robh fhios ’am gun robh thu a’ dol a bhith a’ dol sìos an taobh-sa,

14:25.000 --> 14:26.000
bhithinn air do thogail.”

14:26.000 --> 14:28.000
“Oh,” arsa mise, “dè thuirt thu?”

14:28.000 --> 14:31.000
’S leig mi orm nach robh mi ga chluinntinn, son gum faighinn goirid dhan taigh,

14:31.000 --> 14:34.000
chionn bha a’ bhean aige dìreach a’ dèanamh sandwiches mar siud,

14:34.000 --> 14:35.000
a’ dèanamh plate.

14:35.000 --> 14:38.000
Uill an ath rud a bhalaich, Calum. “Am faigh mi dìnnear an-seo?”

14:38.000 --> 14:40.000
Dh’ith mise am plate, agus bha botal,

14:40.000 --> 14:42.000
tha mi a’ smaoineachadh gun robh e Ryebeck neo rudeigin,

14:42.000 --> 14:45.000
’s mi bha coma, dìreach ag òl mo Ryebeck agus ithe…

14:45.000 --> 14:48.000
Uill, nuair a chaidh mi a-nuas chun a’ bhàta,

14:48.000 --> 14:51.000
air an robh mi ag obair, cha robh accommodation idir,

14:51.000 --> 14:52.000
so chaidil mi air an deck.

14:52.000 --> 14:53.000
July, bha e blàth co-dhiù.

14:53.000 --> 14:56.000
So fhuair mi squeezebox fon cheann agam,

14:56.000 --> 15:01.000
agus am baga beag a bh’ agam so… baga beag an… an Chinaman,

15:01.000 --> 15:03.000
a fhuair mi ann an [XX], bha e agam fhathast,

15:03.000 --> 15:08.000
fhuair mi sin nam chluasag. Agus an làrna-mhàireach,

15:08.000 --> 15:10.000
nuair a thàinig an sgiobair air bòrd son starteadh… 

15:10.000 --> 15:13.000
“Oh is cò an diabhal am fear a tha siud?”

15:13.000 --> 15:15.000
“Sin agad an compressor man, am fear ùr.”

15:15.000 --> 15:17.000
So thug e a-mach chun a’ chompressor

15:17.000 --> 15:21.000
mi is dol a thòisich sinn an-sin, my God.

15:22.000 --> 15:24.000
Cuin a bha sin?
Dè?

15:24.000 --> 15:25.000
Cuin a bha sin?

15:25.000 --> 15:29.000
Dòcha gun robh sin mu 1970, tha mi smaoinntinn, 71.

15:29.000 --> 15:32.000
Agus an do dh’fhuirich sibh ann an Ontario às dèidh sin?

15:32.000 --> 15:36.000
Uill cha robh mi, cha robh mi ro fhada o Ontario an uair a bha sin.

15:36.000 --> 15:38.000
Bha mi anns a’… nuair a bha mi am Montreal,

15:38.000 --> 15:40.000
no, nuair a bha sinn ann am Montreal,

15:40.000 --> 15:42.000
ach bha mi air bàta an-seo son samhradh.

15:42.000 --> 15:45.000
Sia mìosan neo rudeigineach, sin na bha mi ann.

15:45.000 --> 15:48.000
An uairsin, thill sinn air ais agus fhuair mi an uairsin job

15:48.000 --> 15:51.000
air a’ compressor man, an rud a bha seo.

15:51.000 --> 15:52.000
An uairsin, an aon rud a-rithist,

15:52.000 --> 15:55.000
bha mi air deagh job ann a’ Nanticoke,

15:55.000 --> 15:57.000
fhad ’s a [XX].

15:57.000 --> 16:02.000
So fhuair mi ach cha mhòr a h-uile latha, a h-uile dàrna latha,

16:02.000 --> 16:03.000
gun tuirt– gun tàinig vacancy.

16:03.000 --> 16:07.000
Cho luath ’s a thàinig vacancy, a bhalaich: Calum, there it is.

16:07.000 --> 16:09.000
Dè bh’ annam? Oh, boiler-maker.

16:09.000 --> 16:11.000
Dè an diabhal a b’ aithne dhomhsa mu boiler-maker,

16:11.000 --> 16:13.000
ach fhuair mi job co-dhiù, that was all.

16:13.000 --> 16:15.000
Bha pàipear agam a’ can gur e boiler-maker a bh’ annam.

16:15.000 --> 16:17.000
Aye, is fhuair mi job.

16:17.000 --> 16:19.000
Bha mi sin, sin an job a b’ fhaid’ a bh’ agam riamh,

16:19.000 --> 16:22.000
’s bha mi sia bliadhna ann a shin.

16:23.000 --> 16:26.000
Cha do [phòs/?] mi ann trì– naoi miosan,

16:26.000 --> 16:30.000
an job a b’ fhaide a bh’ agam, gus an tàinig mi a Nanticoke.

16:30.000 --> 16:32.000
Bha mi pòsta an-uairsin, so bha mi… sin as adhbhar

16:32.000 --> 16:34.000
gun do dh’fhuirich mi steady ann.

16:35.000 --> 16:37.000
Dè an aois a bha sibh nuair a phòs sibh?

16:37.000 --> 16:41.000
Uhh, bha mi ochd-deug thar fhichead,

16:41.000 --> 16:44.000
math dh’fhaoidte– aye, ochd-deug thar fhichead.

16:44.000 --> 16:50.000
Agus… an do dh’fhàs sibh nas socaire às dèidh sin?

16:50.000 --> 16:52.000
An do sheatlaig sibh sìos?

16:52.000 --> 16:55.000
Uill, a laochain, cha do thòisich– cha do stad, thaobh,

16:55.000 --> 16:58.000
no cha do thòisich mi na bu socaire.

16:58.000 --> 17:01.000
On uairsin, tha an t-eagal orm even a bhith a’ smaoinntinn

17:01.000 --> 17:03.000
cia mheud job a bh’ agam.

17:03.000 --> 17:05.000
Tha mi ag obair fhathast, by the way.

17:05.000 --> 17:07.000
Dè th’ annaibh?

17:07.000 --> 17:09.000
[XX], tha mi ag obair fhathast.

17:09.000 --> 17:13.000
Chaidh mi gu… dè an uairsin a thòisich mi air?

17:13.000 --> 17:16.000
A’ reic insulation airson an taighe.

17:16.000 --> 17:19.000
Fhios agad na leapannan a bhios a’ dol suas is sìos,

17:19.000 --> 17:23.000
fhios agad, chì thu iad [XX]? Bha mi a’ reic an fheadhainn sin.

17:24.000 --> 17:28.000
Na seadaichean, fhios agad, na [XX] sheds, bha mi a’ reic an fheadhainn sin.

17:28.000 --> 17:32.000
Oh, an rud a b’ fheàrr sam bith, actually is, mo phiuthar,

17:32.000 --> 17:37.000
bha thu a’ bruidhinn rithe an-diugh, bha i a’… tha [XX] air taigh mo phiuthair

17:37.000 --> 17:40.000
ann an an— ann am Barraigh, bha i a’ feuchainn ri cheannach.

17:41.000 --> 17:45.000
Bha mi, a laochain, ann am [XX], a’ demonstrateadh, fhios agad,

17:45.000 --> 17:48.000
chan fhaic mi a-nis [XX].

17:48.000 --> 17:50.000
Bidh iad, chan fhaod na truinnsearan a bhristeadh,

17:50.000 --> 17:52.000
dìreach faodaidh tu bhith ga chaitheamh sìos ’s cha bhrist iad.

17:52.000 --> 17:56.000
Uill, sin an rud a bha mise a’ dèanamh, demonstration,

17:56.000 --> 17:59.000
fhios agad, gheibh thu crowd mun cuairt is tòisichidh tu air spiel a thoirt dhaibh

17:59.000 --> 18:00.000
and everything else.

18:00.000 --> 18:05.000
An uairsin, bidh thu a’ tòiseachadh air a’… ach feumaidh tu feuchainn ri daoine neo dhà,

18:05.000 --> 18:06.000
order fhaighinn, fhios agad. 

18:06.000 --> 18:10.000
So bha mi a’ spiel-eadh an latha a bha seo ann am Mont– ann am [XX],

18:10.000 --> 18:13.000
agus dà bhoireannach bha seo, sguir iad air ais air sàilleabh, fhios agad?

18:13.000 --> 18:15.000
Cha do dh’fhalbh iad còmhla ris a’ chrowd.

18:15.000 --> 18:19.000
Oh is feumaidh tu, thàinig dotair so… shoidhn mi esan airson,

18:19.000 --> 18:21.000
oh, rinn mi glè mhath airsan.

18:21.000 --> 18:24.000
Oh, na dotairean, tha iad car glaoiceil co-dhiù so… sgrìobh mi,

18:24.000 --> 18:26.000
fhuair mi, bha mi a’ [treabhadh/?] le mo pheann,

18:26.000 --> 18:28.000
rinn mi a dhà neo trì notaichean an latha ud.

18:28.000 --> 18:30.000
So [XX], bha iadsan a’ seasamh, arsa mise:

18:30.000 --> 18:32.000
“Can– an cuidich mi thusa cuideachd?”

18:32.000 --> 18:34.000
“Oh, dè an diabhal tha thusa a’ dèanamh?

18:34.000 --> 18:37.000
’S e teuchter a th’ annadsa.”

18:37.000 --> 18:39.000
“Dè mar a tha fhios agad air a sin?”

18:39.000 --> 18:42.000
Ars ise: “A thaobh, mo charaid ann an New York,

18:42.000 --> 18:48.000
’s ann à Barraigh a tha i, agus tha mi a’ dol ga fònadh

18:48.000 --> 18:50.000
’s dol a dh’fhaighneachd dhith cò– gum faca mi thusa.

18:50.000 --> 18:51.000
’S dè chanas iad rium?”

18:51.000 --> 18:56.000
Sin agad an nighean aig [XX] piuthar mo bhràth– mo phiuthar-sa,

18:56.000 --> 18:59.000
[XX] ann an Gla– ann am Bàgh a’ Chaisteil.

18:59.000 --> 19:02.000
Sin, mo phiuthar a bha… Sin agad an nighean,

19:02.000 --> 19:04.000
a piuthar shìos ann an New York.

19:04.000 --> 19:06.000
Tha i a-niste shìos am Florida.

19:06.000 --> 19:09.000
Nach e ’n saoghal tha beag? Yeah.

19:09.000 --> 19:13.000
So rinn mi sin is… b’ e deagh jhob a bha sin cuideachd.

19:14.000 --> 19:18.000
Agus na seadaichean, oh Dhia, oh bha, bha siud math.

19:18.000 --> 19:22.000
Chuir iad dhan a’ sgoil mi son ceala-deug, ann an hotel.

19:22.000 --> 19:25.000
Bha triùir againn son serve-adh North America,

19:25.000 --> 19:27.000
dithis Americans agus mise.

19:27.000 --> 19:30.000
Agus… chuir iad ann an hotel sinn.

19:30.000 --> 19:33.000
Uill, a’ chiad seachdain, a bhalaich, am biadh ’s ag èisteachd riutha,

19:33.000 --> 19:35.000
lectures ’s a h-uile sgath bha sin.

19:35.000 --> 19:39.000
Thàinig an uairsin Disathairne ’s Didòmhnaich, tha thu dheth,

19:39.000 --> 19:41.000
agus bha iad a’ toirt dhut latha dheth.

19:41.000 --> 19:44.000
So fhuair mi Tormod, ris an robh mi a’ bruidhinn mu dheidhinn ann an Leòdhas,

19:44.000 --> 19:46.000
fhuair mi e fhèin agus Wendy.

19:46.000 --> 19:48.000
Arsa mise… sa Gheamhradh a bha e:

19:48.000 --> 19:51.000
“An còrdadh e ribhse fuireach ann an hotel son a’ weekend?”

19:51.000 --> 19:52.000
“Carson?”

19:52.000 --> 19:54.000
“Uill tha mi a’ dol a thoirt dhuibh an rùm agamsa,

19:54.000 --> 19:56.000
agus tha mise a’ dol a thighinn dhachaigh shìos ann a sheo.”

19:56.000 --> 19:57.000
Bha mi an Toronto.

19:57.000 --> 19:59.000
“Uill,” arsa mise, “na bruidhinn ri duine–”